<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Bahraini Saudi Bank first half net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bahraini Saudi Bank first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (million Bahraini dinar)</p>
<p> Net profit		 1.8   vs    1.6</p>
<p> Operating income	 3.0   vs    2.5</p>
<p> Operating cost	   0.93  vs    0.89</p>
<p> Net interest income    2.7   vs    2.3</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   28.8   vs   27.4</p>
<p> Assets		   142.6   vs  130.2</p>
<p>Full Name: Bahraini Saudi Bank.</p>
<p>Note - The Bahrain-based bank is owned equally by Bahraini and Saudi investors.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
